Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.19,0:01:47.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}1532年 伦敦\N{\fnArial\fs30}London 1532.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.60,0:03:04.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 公爵阁下 - 托马斯大人\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Your Grace - Lord Thomas.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.37,0:03:05.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}乔普斯大使\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ambassador Chapuys.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.65,0:03:08.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我原以为你抛弃了我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}I thought you had abandoned us.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.26,0:03:10.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是这样 的确如此\N{\fnArial\fs30}It is truth, I did.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.04,0:03:12.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我试过\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or tried to…
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.98,0:03:15.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}只是公平地说 我绝不能抛弃王后陛下\N{\fnArial\fs30}in all conscience, i could never abandon Her Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.09,0:03:19.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}她是世上最高尚 最杰出的女人\N{\fnArial\fs30}She is the most gracious and wonderful woman in the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.53,0:03:20.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}却最悲伤\N{\fnArial\fs30}and the sadest.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.56,0:03:21.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}所见略同\N{\fnArial\fs30}I agree with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.08,0:03:23.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}皇帝陛下同样这么认为\N{\fnArial\fs30}so does the Emperor.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.08,0:03:26.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}陛下特致您一函鼓励\N{\fnArial\fs30}He has writtend this letter of encouragement…
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.39,0:03:27.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}示意支持\N{\fnArial\fs30}and support…
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.57,0:03:29.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}您为她的奔走效力\N{\fnArial\fs30}for your efforts on her behalf.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.84,0:03:34.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我恳求您莫要递交此函给我\N{\fnArial\fs30}I beg you not deliver it to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.12,0:03:37.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}即使我已经对国王\N{\fnArial\fs30}Although that I've given more than sufficient…
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.01,0:03:38.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}显示了足够的忠诚\N{\fnArial\fs30}proof of my loyalty to the king.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.59,0:03:40.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}须知瓜田李下 不能贻人口实\N{\fnArial\fs30}I must do nothing to provoke suspicions.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.85,0:03:42.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}考虑到当前所处的环境\N{\fnArial\fs30}Consider the time we live in.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.08,0:03:46.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我不能失去可以\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't want to be deprived of the liberty…
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.47,0:03:49.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}允许我私下对贵上与王后方面事宜\N{\fnArial\fs30}which allows me to speak boldly in private.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.48,0:03:52.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}建言的自由\N{\fnArial\fs30}About this matters which concern your master and the queen.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.15,0:03:56.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}明白 不必赘言\N{\fnArial\fs30}I understand, you need say no more.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.19,0:04:02.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 谢谢 克伦威尔先生 - 陛下\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Thanks, Mr. Cromwell. - Your Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.94,0:04:04.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}托马斯·莫尔爵士觐见\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sir Thomas More.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.67,0:04:06.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}克伦威尔\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cromwell.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.69,0:04:11.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}托马斯·莫尔爵士\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sir Thomas.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.06,0:04:13.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}国王陛下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.23,0:04:14.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我得告诉你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I must tell you.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.90,0:04:17.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我收到一些众议院议员的陈情\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've received a petition from the members of the House of Commons.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.22,0:04:21.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}投诉高级教士和教职人员的残忍行为\N{\fnArial\fs30}complaining of the cruel behavior and abuses of the prelates.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.38,0:04:22.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}和虐刑\N{\fnArial\fs30}and the clergy.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.19,0:04:25.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}托马斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thomas…
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.55,0:04:29.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}臣民们要求摆脱教会统治\N{\fnArial\fs30}people are asking for freedom from clerical rule.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.98,0:04:32.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}陛下明察\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your Majesty knows…
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.42,0:04:35.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我一直都谴责教会的虐行\N{\fnArial\fs30}very well that I've always condemned the abuses of.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.32,0:04:37.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}当这种行为曝光的时候\N{\fnArial\fs30}the clergy. When they have been brought to light.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.44,0:04:38.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}作为您的首相\N{\fnArial\fs30}As your chancellor,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.93,0:04:40.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我不竭余力来消灭这种现象\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have worked hard to eliminate.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.93,0:04:43.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}净化我们神圣的教会\N{\fnArial\fs30}them and purify our Holy Church.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.34,0:04:45.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但是…\N{\fnArial\fs30}But…
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.33,0:04:48.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}您知道我的立场\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know where I stand.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.00,0:04:52.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}您一直都清楚\N{\fnArial\fs30}You've always known.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.32,0:04:54.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我无法宽恕\N{\fnArial\fs30}I cannot condone this.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.82,0:04:59.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}您基于私人信仰和个人喜好而产生的新观念\N{\fnArial\fs30}new fangled vision of private belief and personal grace.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.69,0:05:04.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}对我来说 教会是上帝存在的永久象征\N{\fnArial\fs30}For me, the church is the permanent and living sign of God's presence.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.97,0:05:08.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}它是生灵活现的社团\N{\fnArial\fs30}It is a visible, palpable community.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.84,0:05:14.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}并非几位教友在密室里的聚会\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not just a few breather and gathered secret rooms.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.21,0:05:22.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}就是说您会反对我？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then, you'll speak against me.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.43,0:05:28.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我对陛下的热爱和对陛下的忠诚\N{\fnArial\fs30}My loyalty and love for Your Majesty is so great.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.65,0:05:31.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}使我绝不会在当众反对您的旨意\N{\fnArial\fs30}that I'll never say a word against you in public.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.84,0:05:36.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}上帝保佑我\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, help me, God.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.22,0:05:48.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}国会 威斯敏斯特\N{\fnArial\fs30}Parliament Westminster.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.53,0:05:52.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}国王驾到 全体起立\N{\fnArial\fs30}Arise for the King!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.46,0:05:59.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 陛下 - 陛下\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Majesty. - Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.14,0:06:11.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}诸位大人 主教大人们\N{\fnArial\fs30}My Lords, Your Graces.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.08,0:06:14.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们齐聚于此 来听取你们对于\N{\fnArial\fs30}We've come here among you to hear your response.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.63,0:06:17.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}指控和所肩负的责任的回应\N{\fnArial\fs30}to the charges and responsibilities laid against you.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.61,0:06:21.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你们均被控支持前任红衣主教渥西\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're generally charged with supporting the authority of the late Cardinal Wolsey,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.02,0:06:26.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}和罗马主教 反对你们自己的国王和国家\N{\fnArial\fs30}and the Bishop of Rome, against that of your own king and country.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.56,0:06:35.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你们有些人可能觉得我在谋求私利\N{\fnArial\fs30}Some here among you may suppose I seek personal advantage.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.14,0:06:37.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}事实并非如此\N{\fnArial\fs30}It is not so.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.38,0:06:43.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}作为国王 我赋有重整世界秩序\N{\fnArial\fs30}As your king, I'm commission to restore right order on Earth.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.63,0:06:46.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}维护我国疆域完整\N{\fnArial\fs30}and assert the immunities and princely liberties.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.99,0:06:49.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}王权不受侵犯的责任\N{\fnArial\fs30}of our realm and crown.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.34,0:06:55.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这是我神圣的职责\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is my sacred duty.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.29,0:06:58.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}此乃面对上帝而定\N{\fnArial\fs30}Seal before God,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.05,0:07:03.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}由我加冕礼的就职宣誓开始\N{\fnArial\fs30}and by solemn oath at my coronation.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.30,0:07:09.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}渥兰大主教 你们的结论是什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What is your conclusion, Archbishop Warham?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.22,0:07:12.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}陛下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your Majesty,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.43,0:07:17.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}在我呈禀之前 我先请最受尊崇的罗彻斯特主教\N{\fnArial\fs30}before I deliver it, I give way to His Grace, the Most Reverend Bishop Fisher,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.73,0:07:19.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}费施尔主教大人发表意见\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Bishop of Rochester.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.94,0:07:29.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}各位大人\N{\fnArial\fs30}My Lords,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.12,0:07:33.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}陛下要求我们确认\N{\fnArial\fs30}we are asked to admit His Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.74,0:07:36.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他为英格兰教会最高领袖\N{\fnArial\fs30}As supreme head of church in England.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.33,0:07:41.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不幸的是 要准予国王此职\N{\fnArial\fs30}Unfortunately, we cannot grant this to the king.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.51,0:07:45.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}就无法不放弃我们与罗马教廷的统一\N{\fnArial\fs30}without abandoning our unity with the See of Rome.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.90,0:07:51.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}如果我们要断绝与天主教世界的一致\N{\fnArial\fs30}If we are to renounce the unity of the Christian world.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.96,0:07:54.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}跳下圣彼得的船\N{\fnArial\fs30}and leap out of Peter's ship.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.61,0:07:58.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那我们都会淹没在异教邪说\N{\fnArial\fs30}then we shall be drown in the waves of all heresies.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.74,0:08:01.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}的巨浪中 四分五裂\N{\fnArial\fs30}sects, schisms and divisions.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.96,0:08:04.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}请恕我直言\N{\fnArial\fs30}I say to you…
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.10,0:08:09.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}认同君权高于我们神圣的教会\N{\fnArial\fs30}that the acceptance of regal supremacy over our holy Church…
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.39,0:08:12.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}将会致使彻底撕裂\N{\fnArial\fs30}would represent a tearing thunder…
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.58,0:08:14.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}基督的无缝外衣\N{\fnArial\fs30}of the seamless coat of Christ.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.48,0:08:21.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}主教大人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your Grace.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.44,0:08:24.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}请给出你们的判决\N{\fnArial\fs30}We will hear your judgement.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.31,0:08:29.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我向国会提议\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll put this proposal to congregation…
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.89,0:08:33.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}国王陛下将被授予新头衔\N{\fnArial\fs30}that Your Majesty has a new title.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.84,0:08:38.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}「英格兰教会和神职人员的最高领袖」\N{\fnArial\fs30}Supreme head of the Church and clergy of England.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.45,0:08:41.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但是我增加了个限制范围\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I add a caveat.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.21,0:08:46.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}只在基督律法允许范围内\N{\fnArial\fs30}As far as the law of Christ allows.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.42,0:08:53.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}赞同的？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Those in favor?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.81,0:09:10.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}很好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Very well.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.02,0:09:13.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}[拉丁语]无声就是默许\N{\fnArial\fs30}Qui tacet consentire videtur.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.21,0:09:18.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}沉默就意味着同意\N{\fnArial\fs30}whoever remain silent so they are assumed to agree.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.77,0:09:27.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}谢谢 主教大人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you, Your Grace.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.95,0:09:51.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}罗马\N{\fnArial\fs30}Rome.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.37,0:10:15.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 坎佩基奥主教 - 圣父\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Cardinal Campeggio - Holy Father.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.98,0:10:19.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}坐吧 坎佩基奥主教\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sit down, Cardinal Campeggio.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.88,0:10:21.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我知道你患有痛风在身\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know you are on hard to gout.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.13,0:10:26.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我的脚也疼死\N{\fnArial\fs30}And my feet are killing me too.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.56,0:10:29.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你找我有何贵干？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do you want to see me about?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.58,0:10:31.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们又收到两封\N{\fnArial\fs30}We have received two new letters…
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.86,0:10:33.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}事关英格兰国王要事的信函\N{\fnArial\fs30}regarding the king of England's great matter.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.98,0:10:36.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}噢 又是此事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh. That again.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.37,0:10:39.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他们怎么说？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What did they say?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.42,0:10:41.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}第一封来自国王本人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well The first is from King himself…
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.60,0:10:45.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}敦促教廷对他取消婚约做出最终\N{\fnArial\fs30}urging curia to make final and favorable decision…
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.25,0:10:48.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}而且有利的决定 以保护英格兰的和平\N{\fnArial\fs30}on his annulment for the sake of peace in England.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.76,0:10:53.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他有几处言辞激烈 教皇陛下\N{\fnArial\fs30}He used some temperate language holiness.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.24,0:10:57.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他抱怨「从未有过任何教皇」\N{\fnArial\fs30}Complaining that "never was any prince handled by a Pope…
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.85,0:10:59.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}「如您一般对待我等君王」诸如此类\N{\fnArial\fs30}as your holiness has treated us".
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.63,0:11:04.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他是指我的前任 坦白讲他没说错\N{\fnArial\fs30}He meant my predecessor, and frankly he has a point.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.57,0:11:07.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}克莱门特确实过于拖拉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Clement was a terrible procrastinador indeed.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.58,0:11:11.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}尽管人们不该将他的尸体挖出来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Although it was very wrong for some people to dig out his dead body.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.42,0:11:12.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}当街凌辱\N{\fnArial\fs30}and stabbed it in the street.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.92,0:11:15.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我还是理解那些人的感受\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can well understand that feelings.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.48,0:11:16.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他从不被人爱戴\N{\fnArial\fs30}He was never popular.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.76,0:11:18.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}愿教皇克莱门特的灵魂安息\N{\fnArial\fs30}Requiescat Pope Clement.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.72,0:11:20.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}第二封信呢？\N{\fnArial\fs30}And second letter?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.79,0:11:23.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}神圣罗马帝国皇帝寄来的 以他的姑妈\N{\fnArial\fs30}From the emperor, on behalf of his aunt.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.82,0:11:26.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}凯瑟琳「伤心的王后」的名义\N{\fnArial\fs30}Katherine, the "unhappy" queen.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.32,0:11:29.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}敦促您制止这婚约的取消\N{\fnArial\fs30}Urging you to prevent the annulment.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.11,0:11:33.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}并把英国国王逐出教会\N{\fnArial\fs30}and excommunicate the king.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.44,0:11:37.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们必须要作决定\N{\fnArial\fs30}It is true we must come to a judgement.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.53,0:11:42.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}另一方面\N{\fnArial\fs30}On the other hand.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.70,0:11:44.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}从保护教会的利益出发\N{\fnArial\fs30}To protect the interests of the Church.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.91,0:11:49.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们要避免顾此失彼得罪任何一方\N{\fnArial\fs30}We should try not to antagonize one par above the other after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.65,0:11:51.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}毕竟他们有士兵和武器\N{\fnArial\fs30}They have soliders and guns.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.51,0:11:54.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们只有美德和真理\N{\fnArial\fs30}whereas we must make duel with beauty and truth.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.33,0:11:59.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那个女孩 娼妇 国王的妓女怎么样了\N{\fnArial\fs30}What of this girl, this putain, the King's whore.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.70,0:12:01.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}安妮·波林\N{\fnArial\fs30}Anne Boleyn.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.11,0:12:04.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是的 为什么没人干脆除掉她呢？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, why doesn't someone just get rid of her?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.55,0:12:24.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.54,0:12:27.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不必起来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't get up.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.71,0:12:34.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}就待在哪儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stay like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.02,0:12:41.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你如此美丽\N{\fnArial\fs30}You are so very beautiful.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.51,0:12:44.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}如此让人向往\N{\fnArial\fs30}So very desirable.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.63,0:12:50.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我无法不全然占有你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have to possess you utterly.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.77,0:13:01.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我迫不及待\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.52,0:13:04.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我的爱人\N{\fnArial\fs30}My love.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.16,0:13:07.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}很快\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just a little longer.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.11,0:13:08.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}到那时再说\N{\fnArial\fs30}And then.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.66,0:13:15.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我已成为英格兰教会的最高领袖\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've made the head of the church of England.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.67,0:13:19.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}真的？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is it true?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.34,0:13:26.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我太开心了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then I am so glad.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.54,0:13:29.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你终于获得自己的权力\N{\fnArial\fs30}At last you have your right.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.28,0:13:32.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}可以随心所欲\N{\fnArial\fs30}and can do as you will.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.33,0:13:39.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我已欣然命克伦威尔粉刷塔里的一些房间\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am glad to have Cromwell refurbish some of the apartments on the tower.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.17,0:13:45.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}英格兰每任王后加冕前都呆在那\N{\fnArial\fs30}Every queen of England stays there before coronation.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.05,0:14:05.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}爸爸\N{\fnArial\fs30}Papa.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.26,0:14:08.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}怎么了？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.17,0:14:10.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你不想庆祝一下吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't you want to celebrate?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.18,0:14:12.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}说这话还为时过早\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's far too early for that.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.14,0:14:14.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}主教们并没有被真正击败\N{\fnArial\fs30}The bishops were not really defeated.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.08,0:14:19.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}由于默认 投票结果为国王当选教会领袖\N{\fnArial\fs30}By default, they voted to make the king head of the Church.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.35,0:14:22.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但「只在基督律法允许范围内」\N{\fnArial\fs30}But only as far as the law of Christ allows.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.27,0:14:27.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你不必是个聪明的律师也知道「基督律法」\N{\fnArial\fs30}You don't have to be a clever lawyer to know that the law of Christ.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.29,0:14:29.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}可以使这次投票结果无效\N{\fnArial\fs30}that may be used to invalidate the vote itself.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.89,0:14:31.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这么说一无所获\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then it was all for nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.72,0:14:35.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.66,0:14:38.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}并非徒劳\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not for nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.46,0:14:41.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}法则已经被他们大部分人所认可\N{\fnArial\fs30}The principle has now been effectively conceded by most of them.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.37,0:14:43.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}乔治告诉我\N{\fnArial\fs30}As George told me.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.57,0:14:47.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他们的抵制与反抗只来自一个人\N{\fnArial\fs30}their resistance and the recalcitrance really stemmed from only one man.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.67,0:14:51.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 该死的费施尔主教 - 费施尔？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- that bloody bishop Fisher. - Fisher.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.25,0:14:59.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 先生 - 克朗默先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Sir. - Mr. Cranmer.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.00,0:15:02.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}克伦威尔先生 很抱歉来迟了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm so sorry to be late, Mr. Cromwell. That's completely unforgivable.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.96,0:15:05.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}胡说 我们还没有开宴 见到你很高兴\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nonsence, We haven't even begun to dine. It's good to see you.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.34,0:15:09.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}波林先生 怀特先生 这是克朗默先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mr. Boleyn, Mr. Wyatt, This is Mr Cranmer.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.23,0:15:14.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}克朗默先生 您是位牧师吧？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mr. Cranmar, you are a man of the cloth I believe.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.23,0:15:16.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}您不是位诗人吗 怀特先生？\N{\fnArial\fs30}And are you not a poet? Mr. Waytt.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.51,0:15:18.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那才是我最轻浮的一点成就\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's the least of my sense.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.67,0:15:20.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}晚餐后你可以聆听我的忏悔\N{\fnArial\fs30}You may take my confession after supper.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.49,0:15:22.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}如果我是你就不听 会让你头发都白了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I wouldn't if I were you. It'll turn your hair white.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.76,0:15:24.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你来之前我们正在讨论\N{\fnArial\fs30}We were discussing before you arrived,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.94,0:15:27.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}主教会议的进展情况\N{\fnArial\fs30}the progress of the Congregation of Bishops,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.51,0:15:29.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}要决定君权至尊的会议\N{\fnArial\fs30}which was called to decide upon the King's supremacy.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.78,0:15:33.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}陛下明智的决定任命乔治·波林\N{\fnArial\fs30}His Majesty has wisely decided to appoint George Boleyn here.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.65,0:15:35.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}与诸位主教进行交涉\N{\fnArial\fs30}to negotiate with Their Graces.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.96,0:15:37.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我发现他们大部分人都很善于变通\N{\fnArial\fs30}I found most of them accommodating.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.12,0:15:40.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}当然 也有数顽固的例外\N{\fnArial\fs30}Of course, there're a few stubborn exceptions.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.52,0:15:42.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我猜是费施尔主教\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bishop Fisher, I assume.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.59,0:15:44.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}True.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.27,0:15:46.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我能问下还有别人吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}May I ask who else?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.45,0:15:49.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}还有大主教本人 渥兰\N{\fnArial\fs30}The archbishop himself. Warren.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.70,0:15:51.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这么些年来他一直很圆滑\N{\fnArial\fs30}After years being perfectly pliable,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.82,0:15:53.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}忽然变得相当强硬\N{\fnArial\fs30}he suddenly become rather intransigent.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.68,0:15:56.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}因为他年纪大了 距离他迟早要面对\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's because he's old, and consequently, he's closer to his maker,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.70,0:15:58.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}的造物主越来越近\N{\fnArial\fs30}to whom undue course he must explain himself?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.77,0:16:01.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那么我相信 会有一个简单之道\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, I'm sure that there'll be a simple matter of him to explain.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.26,0:16:03.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}帮他把教会从迷信\N{\fnArial\fs30}how he helped liberate his church from.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.71,0:16:07.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}和教会贪婪的宗教谎言中解脱\N{\fnArial\fs30}superstition, religious false of the ecclesiastical greed.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.68,0:16:46.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}路斯先生？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mr. Rouss.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.65,0:16:51.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是 先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.15,0:16:54.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你是个厨师\N{\fnArial\fs30}A cook.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.03,0:16:55.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}想要做笔交易\N{\fnArial\fs30}buy trade.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.83,0:16:59.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是 先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.22,0:17:03.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你明白我要你做什么吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You understand what's expected of you?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.73,0:17:10.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}明白 是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I do, yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.47,0:17:13.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这来是补偿你的困难\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is for your trouble.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.74,0:17:25.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}如果你背叛我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you betray us,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.24,0:17:30.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我会毁掉你整个家族\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll destroy your entire family.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.16,0:18:26.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}陛下 这是我常提到的克朗默先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Majesty, this is Mr. Cranmar, whom I have often spoken.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.45,0:18:29.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}正是这位克朗默先生首次提出\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was Mr. Cranmer who first spoke to the fact that.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.80,0:18:32.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}陛下的「要事」是神学问题\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your Majesty's great matter was a theological issue.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.73,0:18:34.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}而非法律问题\N{\fnArial\fs30}and not legal one.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.31,0:18:35.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}克朗默先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mr. Cranmer.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.64,0:18:41.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你是我在所有在世的人中最想见到的一个\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have desire to meet you almost above any person now living.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.68,0:18:44.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你是宫里最受欢迎的上宾\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're most welcome here at court.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.74,0:18:47.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}陛下 我…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Majesty, I…
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.23,0:18:48.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}很有意思\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's funny.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.21,0:18:51.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}王国中一些最伟大最著名的学者\N{\fnArial\fs30}Some of the greatest and most celebrated minds in my kingdom,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.18,0:18:53.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}都为此懊恼不已 而你\N{\fnArial\fs30}sweated and struggled over an issue which you,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.44,0:18:55.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}请原谅我的措辞 一位微贱的牧师\N{\fnArial\fs30}an obscure cleric, if you forgive me,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.91,0:19:00.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}却能轻松又简单的解决了它\N{\fnArial\fs30}was able to resolve with perfect simplicity and a clarity of mind which.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.01,0:19:03.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这真是让他们无地自容\N{\fnArial\fs30}put a mold of shame.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.54,0:19:05.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}陛下 我…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Majesty, I…
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.25,0:19:07.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Um… I…
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.76,0:19:08.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}克朗默先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mr. Cranmer,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.49,0:19:12.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}陛下已决定钦点你为他的私人牧师\N{\fnArial\fs30}His Majesty has decided to appoint you his personal chaplain.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.47,0:19:17.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我…\N{\fnArial\fs30}I… ah…
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.03,0:19:21.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你该感谢陛下的恩典\N{\fnArial\fs30}You must thank His Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.31,0:19:24.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}当然\N{\fnArial\fs30}Of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.00,0:19:26.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}陛下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.23,0:19:31.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不必客气 克朗默先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}You are welcome here, Mr. Cranmer.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.78,0:19:32.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}克伦威尔先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mr. Cromwell.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.98,0:19:34.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}陛下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.76,0:19:41.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}干得好克朗默先生 干得好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well done, Mr. Cranmer, well done.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.94,0:19:45.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你娶了你的被监护人\N{\fnArial\fs30}So you married your ward?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.48,0:19:48.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}她叫什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's her name?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.05,0:19:49.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}凯瑟琳·布洛克\N{\fnArial\fs30}Catherine Brook.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.59,0:19:51.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}凯瑟琳\N{\fnArial\fs30}Catherine.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.56,0:19:53.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}为什么找她\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why her?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.40,0:19:55.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我爱慕布洛克小姐\N{\fnArial\fs30}I love and admire Miss Brooke.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.07,0:19:57.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}让我有被母亲关怀的感觉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Reminds me some of my mother.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.79,0:20:00.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}她多大年纪\N{\fnArial\fs30}How old is she?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.51,0:20:03.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}十七岁\N{\fnArial\fs30}Seventeen.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.13,0:20:07.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}有母亲般的…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Some mother.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.13,0:20:12.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}可怜的凯瑟琳\N{\fnArial\fs30}Poor Catherine.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.23,0:20:14.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你无法对一个女人忠诚 查尔斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're incapable of fidelity, Charles.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.12,0:20:15.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你一直如此\N{\fnArial\fs30}you always have been.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.31,0:20:17.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这次不一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}This time is different.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.74,0:20:19.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}有何不同？\N{\fnArial\fs30}How different?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.41,0:20:24.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我也说不清\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.66,0:20:27.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}就是感觉如此\N{\fnArial\fs30}I just feel it.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.51,0:20:30.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不仅因为她很漂亮\N{\fnArial\fs30}And it's not just because she's beautiful.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.13,0:20:36.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们真的用心相爱\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's a marriage of true souls.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.02,0:20:39.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你应该能明白\N{\fnArial\fs30}Surely you can understand that.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.48,0:20:56.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}阳光 真讨厌\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh sun, go away.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.59,0:21:04.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}永生不要打扰我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Leave us to our own devices.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.22,0:21:11.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我爱你 安妮·波林\N{\fnArial\fs30}I love you. Anne Boleyn.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.66,0:21:14.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我会永远这么爱你\N{\fnArial\fs30}and I always will.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.25,0:21:18.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}永远？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Always?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.35,0:21:21.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你怎么能这么说 托马斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}How can you say that, Thomas?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.70,0:21:26.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}时光流转 命运变迁\N{\fnArial\fs30}No unfortune brings what time changes.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.76,0:21:36.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}可是我不会改变\N{\fnArial\fs30}Time won't change me.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.85,0:21:44.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这个也不会\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or this.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:07.06,0:22:09.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}托马斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thomas.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:18.94,0:22:20.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}安夫人\N{\fnArial\fs30}My lady Anne.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:21.58,0:22:24.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}当恭喜您宠幸之甚\N{\fnArial\fs30}You ought to be congratulated for reaching so high.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:25.70,0:22:27.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}谢谢你 托马斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you Thomas.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:28.03,0:22:31.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我不会忘记我们曾经的友谊\N{\fnArial\fs30}I shall never forget that we were once true friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:31.34,0:22:33.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}噢？\N{\fnArial\fs30}oh?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:33.26,0:22:35.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我倒希望我能忘记\N{\fnArial\fs30}I wish I could forget.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:35.90,0:22:38.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你现在也高升了啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I see you are raised too.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:39.09,0:22:43.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}偶尔处理点外交 承蒙克伦威尔先生器重\N{\fnArial\fs30}well it is a… sometimes diplomat. Thanks to the patronage of Mr. Cromwell.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:43.74,0:22:46.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们这些诗人画家偶尔也能出点力\N{\fnArial\fs30}We poets and painters sometimes have our uses.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:46.92,0:22:49.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我想向你引荐一个人\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's someone here I should like you to meet.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:49.40,0:22:51.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}安妮·波林夫人 这位是马克·斯米顿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lady Anne Boleyn, this is Mark Smeaton.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:51.35,0:22:53.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}大师级舞蹈家 歌唱家 音乐家\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dancing master, singer, musician.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:53.67,0:22:55.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}集各种天赋于一身的全才\N{\fnArial\fs30}and general all-round genius.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:55.85,0:22:56.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}斯米顿先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mr. Smithen.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:56.93,0:22:59.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他喜欢被简单的称呼为马克\N{\fnArial\fs30}He likes to be called just plain Mark.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:59.22,0:23:01.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他怎么能被简简单单的称呼呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}How could he possiblly be called plain?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:01.78,0:23:03.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}夫人\N{\fnArial\fs30}My lady.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:03.77,0:23:05.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}荣幸之至\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's a great pleasure.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:07.76,0:23:09.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你会拉小提琴吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You play the violin?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:09.24,0:23:10.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}会的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Indeed.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:10.70,0:23:12.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}为我演奏一曲吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Play me something.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:13.14,0:23:14.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}当然\N{\fnArial\fs30}Of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:02.52,0:24:04.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}教教我好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Will you show me?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:13.94,0:25:17.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我非常钦佩阁下在主教会议上的演说\N{\fnArial\fs30}I want to thank you Grace your speech to the congregation.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:17.05,0:25:19.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}措辞得体 勇气非凡\N{\fnArial\fs30}It is well said and very brave.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:19.13,0:25:20.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}句无虚言\N{\fnArial\fs30}I spoke only truth.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:20.90,0:25:22.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我认为所谓的限制范围\N{\fnArial\fs30}I believe that the caveat.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:22.80,0:25:27.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}「基督律法允许的范围」实际上推翻了整个提案\N{\fnArial\fs30}So far as the Law of Chist allows does indeed invalidate the whole bill.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:28.75,0:25:33.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}基督率法怎能让一个外人 即使国王\N{\fnArial\fs30}How can the Law of Christ permit a lame man, even the King.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:34.19,0:25:36.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}成为教会的领袖呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}to be head of the church.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:37.06,0:25:39.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}伺童 我只要一点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Boy, a little for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:45.23,0:25:47.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}[拉丁语]以圣父 圣子\N{\fnArial\fs30}In nomine Patris, et Filii,
Dialogue: 0,0:25:47.57,0:25:49.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}圣灵之名\N{\fnArial\fs30}et Spiritus Sancti.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:49.59,0:25:53.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}愿永恒荣耀之王指引我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ad caenam vitae aeternae perducat nos.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:53.12,0:25:55.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}通往永恒生命的晚宴\N{\fnArial\fs30}Rex aeternae gloriae.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:55.60,0:25:57.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}阿门\N{\fnArial\fs30}Amen.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:59.43,0:26:02.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我得问一下 托马斯爵士\N{\fnArial\fs30}I must ask you, Sir. Thomas.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:02.71,0:26:06.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你仍然决意辞职吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you still have a mind to resign your office.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:06.78,0:26:08.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那次投票之后 主教大人\N{\fnArial\fs30}After the vote, Your Grace,
Dialogue: 0,0:26:08.06,0:26:10.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我得承认我确实非常想\N{\fnArial\fs30}I must confess I was sorely tempted.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:11.24,0:26:12.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但三思之后\N{\fnArial\fs30}But on reflection.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:13.69,0:26:16.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我希望留下为天主教而战\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm content to stand in fight for christendom.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:16.58,0:26:18.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这可是个好消息\N{\fnArial\fs30}oh this is excellent news.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:19.67,0:26:22.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}就像大主教最终回心转意一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}as indeed is the turning again of the archbishop.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:23.31,0:26:25.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}感谢上帝 他还有最后的良知\N{\fnArial\fs30}I thank God that his conscience has finally driven him to.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:25.94,0:26:28.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}去谴责国王那些荒唐的把戏\N{\fnArial\fs30}condenm the king's nullity suit.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:28.94,0:26:30.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}而且他也表明了他的意愿\N{\fnArial\fs30}and he's stated his intention to.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:32.11,0:26:34.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}提案反对目前的法规\N{\fnArial\fs30}oppose the legislation.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:38.62,0:26:41.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这有可能妨碍教会的利益\N{\fnArial\fs30}which might be injurious to the church.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:47.72,0:26:49.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}快去叫医生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get the doctor!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:49.80,0:26:51.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}快去叫医生 快\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get the doctor! Quick!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:52.18,0:26:54.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}来人啊 快来人啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Help! Please help!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:54.44,0:26:57.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}上帝啊 上帝啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}God! God!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:59.88,0:27:02.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}四个人痛苦的死去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Four men died of their pains.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:03.29,0:27:06.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}费施尔主教因为食用的汤较少而幸免\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bishop Fisher survived in it because he had too little of the soup.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:08.05,0:27:10.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}真的是非常不幸 托马斯爵士\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's very unfortunate, Sir. Thomas.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:11.04,0:27:13.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}并不仅仅是不幸 陛下\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's more than a unfortune Your Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:15.59,0:27:17.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}费施尔主教的厨师已被逮捕\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now Fisher's cook has been arrested.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:19.11,0:27:20.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但我必须告知您…\N{\fnArial\fs30}but I must tell you that.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:21.85,0:27:25.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}关于密谋毒杀他的凶手身份\N{\fnArial\fs30}rumors abound us to the identities.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:25.24,0:27:26.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}已是谣言四起\N{\fnArial\fs30}of those who plotted against him.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:28.97,0:27:29.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}谁？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:30.66,0:27:32.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}已查出的有威尔特\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wilcherd's being named.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:32.74,0:27:33.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}波林？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bolena?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:33.84,0:27:34.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}正是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:35.38,0:27:36.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}还有…\N{\fnArial\fs30}And?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:38.51,0:27:39.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}还有…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:39.43,0:27:40.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}有些人甚至怀疑是安女士\N{\fnArial\fs30}Some people even blamed the Lady Anne.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:40.98,0:27:43.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}「有些人」把一切事情都怪罪到她头上\N{\fnArial\fs30}Some people would blame her for everything!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:44.57,0:27:46.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}下雨怪她\N{\fnArial\fs30}They would blame her if it rains.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:46.74,0:27:48.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不下雨也怪她\N{\fnArial\fs30}or if the rain fails.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:48.23,0:27:49.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}皇后无法生育是她的错\N{\fnArial\fs30}They will blame her for the bareness of the queen.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:49.54,0:27:51.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我爱她也是她的错\N{\fnArial\fs30}And the fact that I love her.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:51.79,0:27:54.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是她使大风吹毁了庄稼\N{\fnArial\fs30}They will blame her for the wind that destroys our crops.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:54.16,0:27:56.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}让我们的船沉没于暴风雨中\N{\fnArial\fs30}and the storms that sink our ships.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:56.88,0:27:59.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}一切都是安女士的过错\N{\fnArial\fs30}It is all the fault to the Lady Anne.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:09.71,0:28:11.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你呢 托马斯爵士\N{\fnArial\fs30}What about you Sir Thomas?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:11.70,0:28:13.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你也认为她是罪魁祸首吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you blame her?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:14.49,0:28:17.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你认为是她下毒加害费施尔主教的吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do You think she tried to poison Bishop Fisher?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:17.17,0:28:20.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 亨利… - 叫我亨利的时代已经过去了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Henry - The time for Henry is over.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:24.11,0:28:25.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不管主谋是谁\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whoever was to blame.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:26.69,0:28:28.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}厨师路斯 参与预谋\N{\fnArial\fs30}the cook, Rouss, tried,
Dialogue: 0,0:28:28.95,0:28:31.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}且差一点成功毒死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}blatantly, and almost successfully,
Dialogue: 0,0:28:31.41,0:28:34.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}陛下最伟大的公仆之一\N{\fnArial\fs30}to poison to one of Your Majesty's great public servant.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:34.12,0:28:35.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们神圣教会的主教\N{\fnArial\fs30}the bishop of our Holly Church.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:35.43,0:28:36.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}还有我\N{\fnArial\fs30}as well as me.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:38.51,0:28:41.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}如果陛下对此事置之不理\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, if Your Majesty would turn a blind eye to this event.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:41.26,0:28:42.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}大家将不得不认为\N{\fnArial\fs30}everyone will be forced to assume.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:42.68,0:28:45.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}如此的蓄意谋杀\N{\fnArial\fs30}that the attempted murders were.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:46.34,0:28:48.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是得到陛下许可的\N{\fnArial\fs30}done with your blessing.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:01.62,0:29:04.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}伦敦塔\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tower of London.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:08.36,0:29:09.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}波林大人\N{\fnArial\fs30}My lord, Bolena.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:17.67,0:29:19.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}路斯先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mr. Rouss,
Dialogue: 0,0:29:19.21,0:29:23.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这番话我们今天已经问过无数次了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We can go over and over this all day, so,
Dialogue: 0,0:29:23.69,0:29:24.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}问你最后一次\N{\fnArial\fs30}One more time.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:26.30,0:29:27.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}毒药是谁给你的？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who gave you the poison?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:34.09,0:29:35.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}路斯先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mr. Rouss.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:35.06,0:29:36.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}过去四年你都勤勤恳恳\N{\fnArial\fs30}It is inconceivable you should.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:36.47,0:29:37.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}服侍你主人及其家人\N{\fnArial\fs30}suddenly take it upon yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:37.59,0:29:39.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}无法想象你会\N{\fnArial\fs30}to murder your master and his household.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:40.14,0:29:43.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}一时兴起想要谋害他们\N{\fnArial\fs30}after serving him so diligently these past four years.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:43.96,0:29:47.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}毒药是谁给你的？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who gave you the poison?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:52.04,0:29:54.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}先生 我有三个女儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sir, I have three daughters.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:01.93,0:30:03.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这有什么关系吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What does that mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:09.88,0:30:12.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我希望她们能嫁个好人家\N{\fnArial\fs30}I want them to find good husbands,
Dialogue: 0,0:30:13.57,0:30:15.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但这需要钱\N{\fnArial\fs30}but that takes money.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:20.42,0:30:23.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们可以用钱交换你的信息\N{\fnArial\fs30}We can pay you for your information.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:24.70,0:30:25.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不必了 先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, Sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:28.32,0:30:30.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}已经有人付过款了\N{\fnArial\fs30}The payment is already made.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:31.73,0:30:33.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}交易已经达成了\N{\fnArial\fs30}The account settled.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:45.07,0:30:46.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你是个蠢货\N{\fnArial\fs30}You are a fool.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:47.03,0:30:49.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你也会因此而丧命的\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you will die for it.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:05.64,0:31:07.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你 等一下\N{\fnArial\fs30}You, hold a moment.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:15.16,0:31:16.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这匹麻布要送往何处\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where are you taking this linen?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:17.03,0:31:18.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}送到王后陛下哪里\N{\fnArial\fs30}To the Queen's Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:18.72,0:31:19.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}为何？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:19.75,0:31:21.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}为国王陛下缝制衬衣\N{\fnArial\fs30}To make shirts for His Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:21.78,0:31:23.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这是她的惯例\N{\fnArial\fs30}She always has done.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:23.62,0:31:25.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}她仍在为他缝制衬衣？\N{\fnArial\fs30}She still makes his shirts?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:25.78,0:31:27.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是的 安小姐\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes. Yes, Miss Anne.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:04.80,0:32:05.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}甜心\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sweetheart.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:05.94,0:32:07.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你怎么能这样？\N{\fnArial\fs30}How could you?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:08.09,0:32:09.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 什么事 - 你的衬衣\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What? - Your shirts!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:09.61,0:32:11.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}她还在为你缝制衬衣\N{\fnArial\fs30}She still makes your shirts.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:11.05,0:32:12.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你怎么能还让她这么做？\N{\fnArial\fs30}How could you let her?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:12.85,0:32:14.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这事我连想都没想过\N{\fnArial\fs30}I haven't even thought about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:17.18,0:32:18.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你跟我说过你们之间\N{\fnArial\fs30}You told me there was nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:18.71,0:32:20.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}已不存在任何亲密关系了\N{\fnArial\fs30}intimate between you anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:20.56,0:32:21.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}本来就不存在\N{\fnArial\fs30}There isn't.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:21.42,0:32:22.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}有什么亲密？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What intimate?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:22.33,0:32:23.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}看在上帝的份上 不过就是衬衣而已\N{\fnArial\fs30}They are just shirts for God's sake.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:23.83,0:32:26.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}它们不仅仅是衬衣\N{\fnArial\fs30}No they are not just shirts.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:26.09,0:32:27.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}它们代表着我和你\N{\fnArial\fs30}They are you and me,
Dialogue: 0,0:32:27.69,0:32:29.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}它们也代表着你和她之间的关系\N{\fnArial\fs30}They are you and her!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:29.66,0:32:31.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我不明白\N{\fnArial\fs30}I do not understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:31.10,0:32:32.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那你永远都不会明白\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then you won't to.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:33.62,0:32:36.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们即将结婚 而她还赖在这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's so hard when we are to be married.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:36.51,0:32:38.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这算怎么回事\N{\fnArial\fs30}but she's still here!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:38.84,0:32:41.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}一段婚姻里容不下三个人\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can't have three people in a marriage,
Dialogue: 0,0:32:41.88,0:32:43.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}为何你就是明白不了？\N{\fnArial\fs30}why can't you see that?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:43.73,0:32:45.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}而你为何就是不明白\N{\fnArial\fs30}And why can't you understand that.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:45.11,0:32:47.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我还有比衬衣更重要的事情需要考虑\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have more things to think about than my shirts?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:56.35,0:32:58.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}国王已同意采用新的酷刑\N{\fnArial\fs30}The king has agreed to a new and harsh.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:58.47,0:32:59.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}来对付投毒者\N{\fnArial\fs30}treatment to the poisoners.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:00.87,0:33:03.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他们将被活活煮死\N{\fnArial\fs30}They will be boiled alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:05.15,0:33:08.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}在这种情况下严惩案犯是英明的决策\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's wise to have dealt with severity in this case.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:09.36,0:33:11.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但他仍旧无法阻止某些人\N{\fnArial\fs30}But he cannot avoid some suspicions.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:12.79,0:33:15.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}针对安女士和她父亲的猜疑\N{\fnArial\fs30}At least against the Lady Anne and her father.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:17.31,0:33:20.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们的的命运均掌握在上帝手中\N{\fnArial\fs30}We are all in the hands of God.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:23.10,0:33:24.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但我担心\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I worry that.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:24.42,0:33:28.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}当我毫无用处躺在这里的同时\N{\fnArial\fs30}while I lie here uselessly,
Dialogue: 0,0:33:28.51,0:33:30.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}国王可以继续他离婚之事\N{\fnArial\fs30}the king may proceed with his divorce.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:31.04,0:33:34.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}因为他已赋予了自己这个权利\N{\fnArial\fs30}since he has given himself the power.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:35.01,0:33:37.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我被告之 在上次会议中\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was told that on the last council.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:37.52,0:33:39.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}国王盛怒\N{\fnArial\fs30}the king became angry.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:39.95,0:33:41.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他质问\N{\fnArial\fs30}and demanded to know what would happen.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:41.84,0:33:43.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}如果他不顾教皇的批准\N{\fnArial\fs30}if he went ahead anywhere and married Anne.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:43.68,0:33:44.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}义无反顾地与安结婚会怎样\N{\fnArial\fs30}without the Pope's permission.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:45.62,0:33:48.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}大臣们怎么说？\N{\fnArial\fs30}and what did they say?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:48.92,0:33:51.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}只有波林支持他这样做\N{\fnArial\fs30}Only Boleyn supported him.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:51.17,0:33:53.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}连他的朋友布兰顿都表示反对\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not even his friend Brandon.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:54.50,0:33:56.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}感谢上帝\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank God.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:00.17,0:34:01.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}凯瑟琳\N{\fnArial\fs30}Catherine!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:06.69,0:34:07.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}夫君\N{\fnArial\fs30}Husband?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:08.57,0:34:10.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}您感觉好点了吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}How are you feeling?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:10.04,0:34:11.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}what?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:11.07,0:34:12.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他们告诉我你正在遭受牙疼之苦\N{\fnArial\fs30}They told me you have been suffering from a toothache.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:12.96,0:34:14.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我知道那有多疼\N{\fnArial\fs30}which I know it's a terrible pain.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:14.92,0:34:16.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}甚至有人说您患了痛风\N{\fnArial\fs30}And someone even said that you have a touch of a gout.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:17.04,0:34:18.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我怎么可能会痛风\N{\fnArial\fs30}of course that I don't have a gout!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:18.72,0:34:21.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我不明白你怎么会听信这种不着边际的谣言\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know why even you'd listened to such stupid rumors.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:22.29,0:34:24.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}因为我在乎你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because I care for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:26.70,0:34:27.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}凯瑟琳\N{\fnArial\fs30}Catherine.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:28.13,0:34:30.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你不用再为我缝制衬衣了\N{\fnArial\fs30}you're going to have to stop making my shirts.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:31.91,0:34:34.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我还以为你喜欢我为你缝制的衬衣\N{\fnArial\fs30}I thought you like the shirts I made for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:34.12,0:34:35.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你现在就穿着呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}I see you're wearing one.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:38.36,0:34:40.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 亨利… - 又怎么了？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Henry? - What now?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:42.23,0:34:45.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们的女儿玛丽生病了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Our daughter Maria has been none well.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:45.69,0:34:48.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}她已经一连八天粒米未进\N{\fnArial\fs30}She has not kept any food on for eight days now.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:49.18,0:34:51.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}您觉得我们应该去看望她吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you not think we should visit her?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:51.67,0:34:54.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}如果你想去看望公主的话你自己去好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can go and visit the princess if you like.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:54.36,0:34:55.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}然后你就留在那儿吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you can stay there.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:58.95,0:35:01.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不管是为了我们的女儿或者任何人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Even not for our daughter nor for anyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:01.46,0:35:03.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我绝不舍你而去\N{\fnArial\fs30}would I dream of leaving you.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:04.65,0:35:07.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你知道我的合法地位是在你左右\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know my rightful place is by you side.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:21.48,0:35:24.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}恳求上帝的仁慈\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can sign myself to the God's mercy.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:25.96,0:35:27.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}上帝保佑你 先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bless you, Sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:27.32,0:35:29.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}告诉我的女儿们我走得很快\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tell my girls I died easily.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:29.70,0:35:31.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}没有痛苦\N{\fnArial\fs30}and with no pain.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:32.64,0:35:33.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你要头先进去…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Head first?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:34.59,0:35:36.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}还是顺其自然？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or however it comes?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:36.33,0:35:39.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}[拉丁语]无声就是默许\N{\fnArial\fs30}Qui tacet, consentire videtur.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:01.51,0:36:02.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}解救我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Save me!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:08.55,0:37:09.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}坐\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sit.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:16.43,0:37:18.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你妻子真很漂亮\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your wife looks very beautiful.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:19.37,0:37:20.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你们在一起看起来很幸福\N{\fnArial\fs30}You seem very happy together.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:21.23,0:37:22.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}的确如此\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, we are.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:23.69,0:37:26.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}幸福的婚姻是可遇不可求的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Happy marriage is devoutly something to be wished for.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:28.50,0:37:29.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}说到此事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Talking which.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:30.23,0:37:32.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我需要你替我做件事\N{\fnArial\fs30}I need you to do something for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:58.80,0:38:00.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}阁下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your Grace?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:00.24,0:38:01.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}夫人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Madam.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:02.54,0:38:04.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我需要和王后陛下单独交谈\N{\fnArial\fs30}I need to speak to Your Majesty alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:14.11,0:38:15.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}国王派你来的？\N{\fnArial\fs30}The King has sent you.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:15.19,0:38:16.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这个时候？什么事？\N{\fnArial\fs30}at this hour? why?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:18.78,0:38:20.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}国王希望您能明智抉择\N{\fnArial\fs30}The King asks you to be sensible.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:21.42,0:38:22.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}撤销在罗马教廷的上诉\N{\fnArial\fs30}withdraw your appeal to the Rome.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:22.62,0:38:24.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}并将此事交由他处理\N{\fnArial\fs30}and entrust your faith with his hands.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:24.65,0:38:27.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他保证不会亏待您\N{\fnArial\fs30}and he promises to be more than generous.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:28.20,0:38:30.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}您知道国会正在投票通过赋予他\N{\fnArial\fs30}as you know the parliament now is about to make him supreme supereme.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:30.69,0:38:33.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}在俗世及教会里的至高权利\N{\fnArial\fs30}in all matter spiritual as well as temporal.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:33.07,0:38:33.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不行\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:34.63,0:38:37.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}教皇才享有普世最高的权利\N{\fnArial\fs30}Only the Pope has God's power here on earth.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:37.38,0:38:39.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}并象征着永恒的真理\N{\fnArial\fs30}and it's internal truth.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:39.47,0:38:40.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我明白\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:40.64,0:38:42.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 但是国王… - 阁下\N{\fnArial\fs30}- But the King - Your Grace.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:43.72,0:38:45.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}过去到现在 我将一个女人\N{\fnArial\fs30}I love and have loved His Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:45.76,0:38:48.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}最大的爱情赋予了国王陛下\N{\fnArial\fs30}as much as any woman can love a man.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:48.59,0:38:51.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我不会放弃陪伴他做他妻子的每分每秒\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I would not abort him company as his wife one moment.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:52.02,0:38:54.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我都不会违背我自己的良心\N{\fnArial\fs30}against the voice of my conscience.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:54.99,0:38:58.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我是他真正的妻子\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am his true wife.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:01.11,0:39:02.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你大可以去罗马\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go to Rome if you want.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:02.88,0:39:05.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}与众多达官要人去理论\N{\fnArial\fs30}argue it there with lots of important men.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:05.46,0:39:08.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}而不是在这里和一个可怜女人争论\N{\fnArial\fs30}instead of here with just one poor woman.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:41.60,0:39:42.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}她怎么说？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What did she say?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:42.96,0:39:45.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}她说她服从两个至高利益\N{\fnArial\fs30}She said she'll obey Your Majesty and everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:45.59,0:39:49.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}其他一切皆顺从王意\N{\fnArial\fs30}save her obedience to two higher powers.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:49.11,0:39:51.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}哪两个至高利益？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Which two higher powers?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:51.07,0:39:52.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}教皇和神圣罗马帝国皇帝？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pope and the Emperor?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:52.41,0:39:53.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不是\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:54.27,0:39:56.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}上帝和她的良心\N{\fnArial\fs30}God and her conscience.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:07.59,0:40:09.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}乔普斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Chapuys.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:10.24,0:40:11.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}陛下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:11.23,0:40:12.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你可以告诉你的主人…\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can tell your master,
Dialogue: 0,0:40:12.26,0:40:14.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}实际上你告诉谁都无所谓\N{\fnArial\fs30}actually you can tell anyone you like.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:14.19,0:40:16.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}在这件事上我不会向教皇屈服的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I would never agree to be judged by the Pope in this matter.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:16.71,0:40:19.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我毫不在乎法尼斯威胁逐我出教\N{\fnArial\fs30}and I don't care if Farnese tries to excommunicate me.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:19.31,0:40:20.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他可以在罗马为所欲为\N{\fnArial\fs30}He can do what he likes in Rome.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:20.82,0:40:22.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这里是我说了算\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll do what I like here.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:22.77,0:40:23.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}陛下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:24.05,0:40:25.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}还有\N{\fnArial\fs30}and by the way.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:26.51,0:40:28.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}欢迎回宫\N{\fnArial\fs30}Welcome back to court.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:28.87,0:40:29.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}谢陛下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:01.06,0:41:02.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}王后是什么样子的？\N{\fnArial\fs30}How was the queen?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:03.61,0:41:05.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}她很漂亮\N{\fnArial\fs30}She was beautiful.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:05.95,0:41:08.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但自从有你之后她似乎是另外世界的事了\N{\fnArial\fs30}But it's like a thing of the other world once I got you.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:33.85,0:41:36.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我记得你曾经对我说…\N{\fnArial\fs30}I remember once you told me that.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:36.51,0:41:39.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}也许你难免会让我伤悲\N{\fnArial\fs30}You might sometimes have to make me feel sad.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:40.64,0:41:42.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}即使是无心为之\N{\fnArial\fs30}Even if you didn't mean to.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:44.79,0:41:47.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你真的会令我伤心吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you really going to make me sad?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:50.19,0:41:51.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不会\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:52.20,0:41:54.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我对一切神明起誓\N{\fnArial\fs30}I swear to all that is holy.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:54.53,0:41:56.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}以一切美好事物的名义\N{\fnArial\fs30}All things worth being good.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:57.16,0:42:01.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}对你 我将永远忠诚\N{\fnArial\fs30}To you, I will always be true.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:02.42,0:42:03.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}至死不变\N{\fnArial\fs30}Never changing.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:11.85,0:42:14.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}如果你不相信 我也不会怪你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I wouldn't blame you if you don't believe me.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:17.87,0:42:19.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你相信我吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you believe me?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:42.54,0:42:44.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}陛下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:44.21,0:42:47.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 你找我吗？- 安妮\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You're sent for me? - Anne.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:48.03,0:42:50.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}明天去打猎如何？\N{\fnArial\fs30}How should you like to go hunting tomorrow?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:54.48,0:42:57.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}如陛下所愿\N{\fnArial\fs30}If that is what Your Majesty desires.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:57.51,0:42:59.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们也许要离开一些时间\N{\fnArial\fs30}We may be away for a while,
Dialogue: 0,0:43:00.25,0:43:02.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}探访一些人\N{\fnArial\fs30}visit people,
Dialogue: 0,0:43:02.20,0:43:03.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}和他们住上一段时间\N{\fnArial\fs30}stay with them.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:05.46,0:43:08.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}陛下 这葫芦里卖的是什么药？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Majesty, what is this all about?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:08.15,0:43:09.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}当我们归来时\N{\fnArial\fs30}And when we return,
Dialogue: 0,0:43:10.44,0:43:11.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}就只有我们了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We shall be alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:12.79,0:43:14.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}只有我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Alone?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:14.17,0:43:15.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你和我\N{\fnArial\fs30}You and I,
Dialogue: 0,0:43:16.11,0:43:17.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}在皇宫里\N{\fnArial\fs30}here,
Dialogue: 0,0:43:19.01,0:43:20.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}没有了第三者\N{\fnArial\fs30}No third person.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:25.42,0:43:27.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}此话当真？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you mean it?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:27.22,0:43:30.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我已经谕令凯瑟琳离开\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've already given instructions for Catherine to leave.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:33.43,0:43:34.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}天啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, my god.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:40.01,0:43:42.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你是最开心的吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you the most happy?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:15.90,0:44:18.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}夫君 出了什么事情？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Husband, what is this?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:22.77,0:44:24.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 我看到了 - 什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I saw it. - What?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:25.94,0:44:28.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 你看到了什么？- 长久以来\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What did you see? - After a long time…
Dialogue: 0,0:44:30.35,0:44:34.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我知道路德和丁道尔 都是伪先知\N{\fnArial\fs30}I knew Lutheran and Tyndale, false prophet.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:35.28,0:44:37.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那么多的征兆\N{\fnArial\fs30}And so many signs…
Dialogue: 0,0:44:38.97,0:44:41.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我还不明白你在说什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}I still don't understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:41.37,0:44:43.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你到底看到了什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What is it you've seen?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:44.10,0:44:48.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}恶棍 基督的敌人\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Beast. The Antichrist.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:49.45,0:44:51.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他触手可及 爱丽丝\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's near at hand, Alice.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:06.12,0:45:08.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 记得把新的裙子打包 - 遵命 夫人\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You remember to pack me new skirt? - Yes, Madam.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:08.65,0:45:10.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}如此美妙的早晨正适合启程\N{\fnArial\fs30}Beautiful morning for a ride.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:11.39,0:45:13.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}非常美妙\N{\fnArial\fs30}Beautiful.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:18.55,0:45:21.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}好好照顾她 约翰 你自己也小心些\N{\fnArial\fs30}Be very careful with it, John, on your own.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:30.55,0:45:31.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}启驾吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:33.96,0:45:34.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}跟上\N{\fnArial\fs30}Move on.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:11.76,0:46:17.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}夫人 秘书官克伦威尔先生前来觐见\N{\fnArial\fs30}My Lady, Mr. Secretary Cromwell is here to see you.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:17.77,0:46:18.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}夫人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Madam.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:31.39,0:46:34.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}陛下命令您于一个月内离开此地\N{\fnArial\fs30}His Majesty commands that you'll be gone from this place within a month.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:34.79,0:46:37.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}下榻于陛下的莫尔宫\N{\fnArial\fs30}and settle at his house in More.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:42.53,0:46:44.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他甚至都不说告别\N{\fnArial\fs30}He did not even say good-bye.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:51.98,0:46:55.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}当然 您可以带走所有的女佣和侍从\N{\fnArial\fs30}You are free, of course, to take with your attendance and servants.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:59.09,0:47:00.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}无论我到哪里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wherever I go,
Dialogue: 0,0:47:01.72,0:47:03.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我总是他的妻子\N{\fnArial\fs30}I remain his wife,
Dialogue: 0,0:47:03.67,0:47:05.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我会为他祈祷\N{\fnArial\fs30}and I'll pray for him.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:11.23,0:47:12.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}还有… 一件事\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's ah… a further matter.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:15.22,0:47:16.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}陛下希望你将属于\N{\fnArial\fs30}His Majesty wishes.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:16.29,0:47:20.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}英格兰王后的王室珠宝归还\N{\fnArial\fs30}that you return to him the official jewels of Queen of England.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:28.90,0:47:30.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No!
Dialogue: 0,0:47:30.98,0:47:33.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我不会放弃我的合法所有\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll not give up with these rightfully mine.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:33.82,0:47:37.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}去装饰一个让所有天主教徒不齿的女人\N{\fnArial\fs30}to adorn a woman who was the scandal of Christendom.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:24.87,0:48:26.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}上帝保佑陛下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bless Your Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:28.07,0:48:31.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}王后陛下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:32.53,0:48:34.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}上帝保佑王后陛下 上帝保佑\N{\fnArial\fs30}God bless Your Majesty. God bless you.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:34.99,0:48:35.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:35.77,0:48:38.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 上帝保佑王后陛下 - 谢谢你们\N{\fnArial\fs30}- God bless Your Majesty! - Thank all of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:53.19,0:48:54.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}受天眷的女士\N{\fnArial\fs30}Blessing Lady.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:55.47,0:48:57.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}万众爱戴的王后\N{\fnArial\fs30}Queen of Hearts.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:57.47,0:49:01.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}当你回到伦敦时\N{\fnArial\fs30}There will be even greater crowds than this to welcome you…
Dialogue: 0,0:49:01.50,0:49:03.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}欢迎的人群会比今天更多\N{\fnArial\fs30}when you return to London.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:49.72,0:49:51.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}谁？进来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes? Come.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:58.92,0:50:00.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}顺利吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well?
Dialogue: 0,0:50:00.75,0:50:05.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}陛下 我受命向您传达来自王后的告别\N{\fnArial\fs30}Majesty, I'm asked to pass on a message of farewell from the Queen.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:05.83,0:50:09.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}她很遗憾未能与您亲自话别…\N{\fnArial\fs30}She regrets that you did not wish her goodbye,
Dialogue: 0,0:50:09.67,0:50:13.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}最后她询问了陛下的健康状况\N{\fnArial\fs30}and she inquires after Your Majesty's health.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:26.70,0:50:29.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}告诉王后我不需要她的告别\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tell the Queen! I do not want any her goodbyes,
Dialogue: 0,0:50:30.04,0:50:34.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}另外 我无意安慰她\N{\fnArial\fs30}and I do not wish to offer her consolation!
Dialogue: 0,0:50:34.10,0:50:36.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我不在乎她是否问候我健康\N{\fnArial\fs30}I do not care whether she ask after my health or not.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:36.62,0:50:39.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}让她别再烦扰 专心做自己的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let her stop this, and mind our own business!
Dialogue: 0,0:50:39.22,0:50:41.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 听明白了吗？- 遵命 陛下\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Do you understand me! - Yes, Your Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:41.82,0:50:43.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}滚出去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get out!
Dialogue: 0,0:50:58.97,0:51:00.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}抱歉\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:00.78,0:51:02.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不用道歉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't apologise.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:14.73,0:51:16.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}还能有何不同呢？\N{\fnArial\fs30}How could things be different?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:20.13,0:51:22.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}一切都如此美妙\N{\fnArial\fs30}Indeed, everything is beautiful.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:25.95,0:51:28.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}难道你不认为？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't you think?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:28.12,0:51:30.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}一切都很美妙吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Everything is beautiful?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:36.00,0:51:37.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:39.01,0:51:41.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}一切都如此美妙\N{\fnArial\fs30}Everything is beautiful.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:58.53,0:52:00.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}她是个女巫\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's a witch,
Dialogue: 0,0:52:00.22,0:52:03.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}她的命运只配下地狱\N{\fnArial\fs30}who deserves all the fate and to be dispatched to hell.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:04.78,0:52:07.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你会去刺杀安妮女士吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you will assassinate The Lady Anne?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:07.96,0:52:09.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}作为国王的近身侍从\N{\fnArial\fs30}Being the closer servant of the King.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:09.70,0:52:11.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我可以做到\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm in a position to do so.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:13.59,0:52:15.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}为了自己的欲望 她引诱蛊惑了他\N{\fnArial\fs30}with her lust She seduced and bewitched him.
